synergy = "Needs structure ×1.30 (TL-3, TN-9). The hit is the slide hit × 1.8: mass × usable strength × impact, so a heavy plated body kills with it and a light one only shoves. Lighter bodies fly faster. Each burn costs 7 kJ of reserve and 4.5 kJ of heat."
